{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42405","headline":"太傅相公与家兄梅花詶唱许缀末篇再赐新诗俯光拙句谨奉清韵用感钧私伏惟采览 · 徐锴","name":"太傅相公与家兄梅花詶唱许缀末篇再赐新诗俯光拙句谨奉清韵用感钧私伏惟采览","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重叹梅花落，非关塞笛悲。\n论文叨接萼，末曲愧吹篪。\n枝逐清风动，香因白雪知。\n陶钧敷左悌，更赋邵公诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐锴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}